## Metadata dataset

The descriptive metadata contained in `data/glagolab_zadar_archdiocese_metadata.csv` originate from the GlagoLab catalogue of the Centre for Research in Glagolitism, University of Zadar:
https://glagolab.unizd.hr
No additional licence for redistribution or reuse of these metadata is asserted through this repository unless explicitly stated in the corresponding dataset documentation or Zenodo record.

See `data/README.md` for information about the source, provenance, and applicable rights and reuse conditions.
